es).  \n- After that, Black can bring the king closer or use bishop to cover escape squares, setting up a quick checkmate.  \n- It avoids unnecessary pawn moves or non-check moves that might allow stalemate risks later (though minimal here).  \n\nAnswer: Q: e2-e1'}
